*.pyc

# Round 18 acquisition sweep: 1.8 GB of raw third-party data.
# Manifests, indices and derived tables are committed under query/acquisition/;
# the payloads are re-downloadable with atlas/tools/{geo,ctg,epmc}_*.py
acquire/

