# R478: 1000 Genomes phase 3 EUR PLINK LD reference panel (MRC IEU), ~1.1 GB of
# re-downloadable third-party data. Re-fetch with:
#   curl -sS "http://fileserve.mrcieu.ac.uk/ld/1kg.v3.tgz" \
#     | tar -xz --wildcards -C atlas/data/ld '*EUR*'
# NOTE: the origin server's HTTPS certificate has EXPIRED; plain http:// works.
atlas/data/ld/
